voice keys  inst=epiano auto=comp pattern=x.x.x.. lo=55 hi=72 size=3 vol=0.15 pan=0.22 rev=0.18 gate=0.55 decay=3
voice warm  inst=epiano auto=arp:broken rate=2 lo=55 hi=74 vol=0.2 pan=0.2 rev=0.34 human=0.005
